    "detailed_description": "This game was developed for one player with the aim of differentiating itself from existing fighting games.<br>The closest feeling to a real battle in the history of existing games.<br>You can attack by moving the right stick up, down, left, right, up and down, and you can use more powerful moves by using the R button and the R trigger.<br>You can avoid attacks by moving in the direction of the opponent's attack.<br>Each time you attack, your stamina will decrease, and if it decreases further, it will decrease to a negative value.<br><br>There is a mode to fight the CPU, and five difficulty levels from Very Easy to Very Hard.<br>This game is difficult, so be sure to start with Very Easy.<br>Watch out for and avoid your opponent's big attack and turn to counterattack!<br>Can you beat the belly hard?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810790/extras/57d92696041952b792a04634e70ae51c.poster.avif?t=1709293192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810790/extras/57d92696041952b792a04634e70ae51c.webm?t=1709293192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810790/extras/57d92696041952b792a04634e70ae51c.mp4?t=1709293192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
